    comment "en" """
        Source V49.01 = driver of car injured in collision with MV in nontraffic accident while at
        leisure/play (Swedish sub-code of V49.0 adding activity context). Base ICD-10 V49.0 (Athena
        45595080) crosswalks to SNOMED CT 432510 (Driver in vehicular AND/OR traffic accident, standard,
        active) and 437738 (Motor vehicle accident off public road). The Swedish code adds activity
        (leisure) which has no separate SNOMED CT target; the standard targets fully subsume the source.
        broader, one level, verified crosswalk =.
        """
}
