    comment "en" """
        Source V4944 = Swedish-SE extension of V49.4 (Driver of car injured in collision with motor
        vehicle in traffic accident) with 6th-char activity suffix SNOMED CT 274913009 48084008 =
        vitalaktiviteter (vital activities: rest/sleep/meal/personal hygiene). V49.4 base has Athena
        Maps-to to 432510 (Driver in vehicular AND/OR traffic accident) and 433930 (Motor vehicle on
        road in collision with another motor vehicle). The activity suffix is a Swedish national
        administrative add-on with no SNOMED CT analogue; targets fully capture the injury-role and
        collision axes but are silent on the activity dimension. Broader: target subsumes the clinical
        injury content, drops only the administrative activity axis. Confidence moderate: crosswalk
        verified for the base V49.4 code, applied mechanically to the SE-extension child, not
        independently re-verified.
        """
}
